The main function demonstrates how to allocate and use the logging system, including freeing all allocated memory when done. This example assumes a simple PRNG for demonstration purposes; in a real-world scenario, you might choose a more robust algorithm like the Mersenne Twister or Xorshift for better performance and variability."]

